      "refersTo": "navigation-selected",
      "description": "Numbered experiment choices with an explicit current selection.",
      "html": "<nav aria-label=\"Experiments\"><button class=\"ds-nav ds-selected ds-focus\" aria-current=\"page\"><span class=\"ds-number\">01</span><span class=\"ds-copy\"><strong>One cell, any node</strong><small>Ownership &amp; routing</small></span><svg width=\"16\" height=\"16\" viewBox=\"0 0 24 24\" fill=\"none\" stroke=\"currentColor\" stroke-width=\"2\" aria-hidden=\"true\"><path d=\"m9 18 6-6-6-6\"/></svg></button></nav>",
